description: FormaCraft AI-first architecture invariant for every coding session.
alwaysApply: true
---

FormaCraft MUST remain an open-world AI architectural planner. Read root `AGENTS.md` and the current `ARCHITECTURE.md`/`docs/architecture/GENERATION_AUTHORITY_MAP.md` before modifying prompt, planning, routing, normalization, generator, repair or fallback logic.

Never substitute a hardcoded building, style, roof, facade, composition or preset for the user's or model's architectural decision. Deterministic geometry and hard constraints are allowed. Treat keyword rules as non-binding hints only. Unknown buildings must remain composable; execution gaps return a documented `capability_gap`, not a disguised template. For these changes, run `.cursor/skills/formacraft-design-authority-audit/SKILL.md` and provide evidence.

Do not grow `RequestIntentInjector` or `building_contract.py` with new regex / hard patches for geometry failures. Prefer diagnose→`capability_gap`→bounded repair guard→recompile loops (see `FlatRoofCoverageValidator` / `FlatRoofRepairGuard` and `docs/architecture/AI_DESIGN_AUTHORITY_GUARDRAILS.md` anti-rebound section).
